<title>GERMANY: VW details Q1 1997 customer deliveries.</title>
<headline>VW details Q1 1997 customer deliveries.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in thousands of vehicles)</p>
<p>    Group customer vehicle deliveries    1,033   vs 943</p>
<p>Of which by region:</p>
<p>    -- Western Europe			    608   vs 593</p>
<p>    -- Central and Eastern Europe	     62   vs  49</p>
<p>    -- North America				55   vs  48</p>
<p>    -- South America and Africa		198   vs 168</p>
<p>    -- Asia-Pacific				 97   vs  76</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
